{"v":4,"catch":"粉絲對正統射手很滿意！\n可愛的角色擴大了粉絲群！","desc":"《FANTASTIC NIGHT DREAMS COTTOn》是SUCCESS於1991年發行的射擊遊戲。\n控制主角COTTON，使用射擊、炸彈和魔法消滅恐懼統治仙界的獸心。\n這款射擊遊戲擁有適合愛好者和初學者的遊戲玩法。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-11-28","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f7e4e3fe7ab7a0f15970c452c0f5136de0473586d6871f7cad1bba00459e45e0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/86c460d020848f619a94de48d374db9fc8e25c31a29cbff4d73c941d92e732a1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5a0b958ab2fa9d750b9d4ae28fda95248d550517112175a8714840585f21a575.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1a7daf76b0f25ecf043466c3c966467b22a200f18e20a293dc470f63c8b9f00b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/70c58e86f2c518884d3602804f8ea33f4b7d25cf67f200c9bb3442615326889a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/aec687265b5349588066748449d0fc535e0f50083cdadcb4d3791b3786ee6242.jpg"],"titleId":"0100dda020b80000","dlc":[]}